<rml>
<head>
	<title>KinuUI Piano Roll</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../../../assets/rml.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="piano_roll.rcss"/>
</head>
<body onmousemove="piano-move" onmouseup="piano-release" onmouseleave="piano-release">
	<div id="piano-app">
		<header class="piano-heading"><b>ピアノロール</b><strong id="piano-track-name"></strong><span>4小節</span></header>
		<div class="piano-ruler-row"><b>鍵盤</b><div class="piano-ruler"><div id="piano-ruler-content"></div></div></div>
		<main class="piano-board">
			<aside class="piano-keyboard"><div id="piano-key-content"></div></aside>
			<section id="piano-scroll"><div id="piano-grid" ondblclick="piano-add"></div></section>
		</main>
		<section class="piano-velocity-row"><b>ベロシティ</b><div class="piano-velocity"><div id="piano-velocity-content"></div></div></section>
		<footer class="piano-footer"><span>ノートをダブルクリックで追加、右クリックで削除</span><b>ドラッグで移動・右端で長さ変更 / ホイールでベロシティ</b></footer>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
